WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.746
Research experiments backed by the C++ simulator

00:00:04.746 --> 00:00:12.493
Configure a synthetic market-making experiment

00:00:12.493 --> 00:00:18.736
Pause, step scheduler events, and resume a real run

00:00:18.736 --> 00:00:23.883
Inspect equity, inventory, drawdown, and exact accounting

00:00:23.883 --> 00:00:33.529
Trace a fill through events, queue position, and its lifecycle

00:00:33.529 --> 00:00:41.436
Compare three common seeds and expose changed assumptions

00:00:41.436 --> 00:00:47.117
Read paired differences and dispersion, then drill into a seed

00:00:47.117 --> 00:00:54.080
Return to the auditable run summary
